### Configuration Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Health & Version Checks
# -------------------------------------------------------------

### Get API Health Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Get API Version Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/version
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Authentication & Shop Owner Registration
# -------------------------------------------------------------

### Register Shop & Owner Account (Valid)
# This creates a new Shop tenant and registers the OWNER user.
# @name registerOwner
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "shopName": "Gentlemens Cut",
  "shopSlug": "gentlemens-cut",
  "shopEmail": "contact@gentlemenscut.com",
  "ownerFirstName": "Alex",
  "ownerLastName": "Mercer",
  "ownerEmail": "alex@mercer.com",
  "ownerPassword": "superSecurePassword123"
}

###

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Login Flow
# -------------------------------------------------------------

### Login (Valid Credentials)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alex@mercer.com",
  "password": "superSecurePassword123"
}

###

# Save the Access token from login response
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Employee Management
# -------------------------------------------------------------

### Add Employee (Owner/Manager Only)
# Creates a new employee inside the owner's shop and generates a sequential employee code.
# @name createEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Barber",
  "email": "john.barber@example.com",
  "phone": "555-0199",
  "role": "BARBER",
  "employmentType": "FULL_TIME",
  "salaryType": "MONTHLY",
  "salary": 3200,
  "commissionEnabled": true,
  "commissionRate": 15
}

###

# Save the Employee ID from createEmployee response
@employeeId = {{createEmployee.response.body.data.id}}

### Get All Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Get Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Update Employee Details (Owner/Manager Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Johnathan",
  "salary": 3500
}

###

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Attendance (Clock-In / Clock-Out)
# -------------------------------------------------------------

### Clock In Employee
# Creates an active attendance record and sets isClockedIn = true.
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/clock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "notes": "Starting morning shift"
}

###

### Clock Out Employee
# Clocks out, calculates worked minutes and overtime hours, and sets isClockedIn = false.
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/clock-out
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "notes": "Finished shift"
}

###

### Get Shop Attendance History (Owner/Manager Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Get Employee Specific Attendance History
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Employee Deactivation
# -------------------------------------------------------------

### Deactivate Employee (Soft Delete - status = INACTIVE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}
